        Non-monster-specific Artifact Damages For Nethack 3.1.1
       =========================================================

               by Henri Block (Block@klaava.Helsinki.FI).


Data from Robert DeLoura's Weapons Guide and Paul Richardson's artifact
list. Many other peoples have helped. These damages are without a ring
of increase damage and with Str 6-15.


blessed +3 Cleaver
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
vs. small monster       vs. large monster       vs. major demon
2-12 (battle axe)       3-14                    3-14
                                                4-18 (bl. vs. und.)
5-15 (+3)               6-17                    7-21
6-21 (artifact)         7-23                    8-27
13.5 (average)          15                      17.5

Cleaver is a two-handed weapon. Neurtal.


blessed +3 Excalibur
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
vs. small monster       vs. large monster       vs. major demon
1-8  (long sword)       1-12                    1-12
                                                2-16 (bl. vs. und.)
4-11 (+3)               4-15                    5-19
5-21 (artifact)         5-25                    6-29
13   (average)          15                      17.5

Excalibur gives protection against level-drain and searching. Lawful.


blessed +3 Frost/Fire Brand
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
vs. small monster       vs. large monster       vs. major demon
1-8  (long sword)       1-12                    1-12
                                                2-16 (bl. vs. und.)
4-11 (+3)               4-15                    5-19
8-22 (artifact)         8-30                    8-38
15   (average)          19                      23

Frost Brand does no special damage to cold resistant creatures.
Fire Brand does no special damage to fire resistant creatures.
Both Neutral.


blessed +3 Vorpal Blade
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
vs. small monster       vs. large monster       vs. major demon
1-8  (long sword)       1-12                    1-12
                                                2-16 (bl. vs. und.)
