5-12 (artifact)         5-16                    6-20
8.5  (average)          10.5                    13

Vorpal Blade has a 10% chance of instant killing by beheading the monster.
Vorpal Blade always beheads Jabberwocks. Neutral.


blessed +3 Grayswandir
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
